-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete-ws1504716"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030","text":"　　如以江夏心異先臣，受制臣力，則江夏同致死斃，聽可昏政淫刑，見殘無道。然江夏之異，以何爲明，孔、呂二人，誰以爲戮。手御麾幡，言輙任公，同心共志，心若膠漆，而以爲異，臣竊惑焉。如以先臣遣使，江夏斬之，則征東之驛，何爲見戮？陛下斬征東之使，寔詐山陽；江夏違先臣之請，實謀孔矜。天命有歸，故事業不遂耳。夫唯聖人，乃知天命，守忠之臣，唯知盡死，安顧成敗。詔稱江夏遭時屯故，迹屈行令，內恕探情，無玷純節。今茲之旨，又何以處鎮軍哉？","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":72,"last_line":72,"raw_start":5668,"raw_end":5880,"raw_character_offsets":[5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686,5687,5688,5689,5690,5691,5692,5693,5694,5695,5696,5697,5698,5699,5700,5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706,5707,5708,5709,5710,5711,5712,5713,5714,5715,5716,5717,5718,5719,5720,5721,5722,5723,5724,5725,5726,5727,5728,5729,5730,5731,5732,5733,5734,5735,5736,5737,5738,5739,5740,5741,5742,5743,5744,5745,5746,5747,5748,5749,5750,5751,5752,5753,5754,5755,5756,5757,5758,5759,5760,5761,5762,5763,5764,5765,5766,5767,5768,5769,5770,5771,5772,5773,5774,5775,5776,5777,5778,5779,5780,5781,5782,5783,5784,5785,5786,5787,5788,5789,5790,5791,5792,5793,5794,5795,5796,5797,5798,5799,5800,5801,5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819,5820,5821,5822,5823,5824,5825,5826,5827,5828,5829,5830,5831,5832,5833,5834,5835,5836,5837,5838,5839,5840,5841,5842,5843,5844,5845,5846,5847,5848,5849,5850,5851,5852,5853,5854,5855,5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875,5876,5877,5878,5879],"revision_id":1504716},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"先臣","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"先臣","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_F","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"先臣","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"孔矜","kind":"person","person_id":"dqj_o4d_25b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p030:m0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"鎮軍","kind":"person","person_id":"987_u9q_ljk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-051","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete-ws1504716"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033","text":"　　若陛下猶以爲疑，鎮軍未之允決，乞下征東共詳可否，無以向隅之悲，而傷陛下滿堂之樂。何則？陛下昏主之弟，江夏亦昏主之弟；鎮軍受遺託之恩，先臣亦荷顧命之重。情節無異，所爲皆同，殊者唯以成敗仰資聖朝耳。臣不勝愚忠，請使羣臣廷辯者，臣乞專令一人，精賜本語。僥幸萬一，天聽昭然，則軻沈七族，離燔妻子，人以爲難，臣豈不易。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":78,"last_line":78,"raw_start":6281,"raw_end":6438,"raw_character_offsets":[6282,6283,6284,6285,6286,6287,6288,6289,6290,6291,6292,6293,6294,6295,6296,6297,6298,6299,6300,6301,6302,6303,6304,6305,6306,6307,6308,6309,6310,6311,6312,6313,6314,6315,6316,6317,6318,6319,6320,6321,6322,6323,6324,6325,6326,6327,6328,6329,6330,6331,6332,6333,6334,6335,6336,6337,6338,6339,6340,6341,6342,6343,6344,6345,6346,6347,6348,6349,6350,6351,6352,6353,6354,6355,6356,6357,6358,6359,6360,6361,6362,6363,6364,6365,6366,6367,6368,6369,6370,6371,6372,6373,6374,6375,6376,6377,6378,6379,6380,6381,6382,6383,6384,6385,6386,6387,6388,6389,6390,6391,6392,6393,6394,6395,6396,6397,6398,6399,6400,6401,6402,6403,6404,6405,6406,6407,6408,6409,6410,6411,6412,6413,6414,6415,6416,6417,6418,6419,6420,6421,6422,6423,6424,6425,6426,6427,6428,6429,6430,6431,6432,6433,6434,6435,6436,6437],"revision_id":1504716},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_F","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"鎮軍","kind":"person","person_id":"987_u9q_ljk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_F","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_F","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"昏主","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p033:m0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"江夏","kind":"person","person_id":"